// Décrire une architecture
"This component is responsible for handling authentication."
"It talks to the database through an ORM."
"We decoupled these two services to scale them independently."

// Expliquer un compromis technique
"The trade-off here is between consistency and latency."
"This approach is more scalable, but harder to maintain."
"We chose eventual consistency to favor read performance."

// Parler de son rôle (pas seulement 'I worked on')
"I owned the migration from monolith to microservices."
"I led a team of three engineers on this feature."
"I was the point of contact between the backend and mobile teams."
